## Review fixes (semantic_reviewer, /projects/sandbox/reviews/pr1480.md)
$ npx vitest run src/hooks/useChatViewingPresence.test.ts   # 13 passed (was 5)
$ npx vitest run src/components/messages src/pages/messages src/hooks src/lib/messaging   # 108 files / 588 tests passed
Fixed: hidden page (the browser fires it before pagehide) sends active:false at once with fetch keepalive and the last token (test uses the real hidden→pagehide order); posts are queued in order and a waiting active:true is dropped when viewing ended (never lands after the false); a false is only sent if a true may have gone out; a failed first post (signed out / offline / 4xx / 5xx — res.ok is checked) arms no heartbeat and is retried after 20 s or on the next focus/visibility; the token for keepalive follows onAuthStateChange; no call when the build names no gateway (VITE_GATEWAY_BASE / VITE_GATEWAY_URL — staging and prod builds set both); tests split and cleaned up (unstub globals/envs, visibilityState restored).
Known and accepted: a duplicated tab copies the sessionStorage device id; then one tab's active:false clears the other's row → a push arrives (fail-open).
